    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold to rise and release to dive. Avoid countless obstacles and fight almighty bosses to reclaim your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to our original soundtrack while collecting seeds to buy all the clothes and fight with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 21st century, the country became the stage for one of the greatest calamities of our time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Louis, a worm fighting for a balanced meal in a hostile world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is sweet \u2014 but it can be sour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oranges, kiwis, apples\u2026 every blessing in this tropical paradise becomes a deadly threat to those who dare rise for lunch. Escape the dangers and reach the finish line to battle the fruit's boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for what\u2019s yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought that chainsaws and pie-throwing machines were the worst you'd find inside an apple? These fruits have owners \u2014 and they don\u2019t like to share.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the fairest of them all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seeds are like gold, and in this world, gold buys style. Unlock all the outfits for Louis and dress for glory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hold to rise and release to dive. Avoid countless obstacles and fight almighty bosses to reclaim your home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to our original soundtrack while collecting seeds to buy all the clothes and fight with style!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the 21st century, the country became the stage for one of the greatest calamities of our time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Louis, a worm fighting for a balanced meal in a hostile world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world is sweet \u2014 but it can be sour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oranges, kiwis, apples\u2026 every blessing in this tropical paradise becomes a deadly threat to those who dare rise for lunch. Escape the dangers and reach the finish line to battle the fruit's boss.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight for what\u2019s yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You thought that chainsaws and pie-throwing machines were the worst you'd find inside an apple? These fruits have owners \u2014 and they don\u2019t like to share.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be the fairest of them all</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your seeds are like gold, and in this world, gold buys style. Unlock all the outfits for Louis and dress for glory.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Mouth is trying to take over Louis's place. Hold to rise and release to dive. Dodge obstacles, travelling from fruit to fruit, collecting seeds, buying clothes and battling almighty monsters to reclaim your home with style!",
